+        // from KillzoneRecomp's patch 0017 (Copyright (c) 2026 drakolordx7, MIT). The function body is generated with
+        // the classic macros, in chunks (one instruction, one branch with its delay slot, one label); every chunk that
+        // only computes is rewritten to keep the guest GPRs in C++ locals, and every chunk that hands ctx to other code
